stateDiagram-v2
  accTitle: Verifiable Intent mandate pair state held by the network
  accDescr: State diagram: Verifiable Intent mandate pair state held by the network. 5 states: Unfulfilled, Fulfilled, Recurring (agent_recurrence), Exhausted, and Expired. Starts in Unfulfilled. Ends in Fulfilled, Exhausted, and Expired. 5 transitions. From Unfulfilled to Fulfilled when Network accepts the first L3a for the pair (None defined in the spec). From Unfulfilled to Recurring (agent_recurrence) when First L3a accepted with mandate.payment.agent_recurrence present. From Recurring (agent_recurrence) to Recurring (agent_recurrence) when Further L3a within counters and budget. From Recurring (agent_recurrence) to Exhausted when Counter, budget or end_date limit reached. From Unfulfilled to Expired when L2 exp passes before fulfillment.
  state "Unfulfilled" as s_unfulfilled
  state "Fulfilled" as s_fulfilled
  state "Recurring (agent_recurrence)" as s_recurring
  state "Exhausted" as s_exhausted
  state "Expired" as s_expired
  [*] --> s_unfulfilled
  s_unfulfilled --> s_fulfilled : Network accepts the first L3a for the pair
  s_unfulfilled --> s_recurring : First L3a accepted with mandate.payment.agent_recurrence present
  s_recurring --> s_recurring : Further L3a within counters and budget
  s_recurring --> s_exhausted : Counter, budget or end_date limit reached
  s_unfulfilled --> s_expired : L2 exp passes before fulfillment
  s_fulfilled --> [*]
  s_exhausted --> [*]
  s_expired --> [*]
  note right of s_unfulfilled : L2 Autonomous signed#59; no L3 pair accepted yet.
  note right of s_fulfilled : One L3a and L3b pair accepted (base model).
  note right of s_recurring : Counters occurrence_count and cumulative_spent advance with each L3a.
  note right of s_exhausted : max_occurrences, budget max or end_date reached.
  note right of s_expired : L2 exp passed#59; the user should be prompted to authorize again.
